1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:08,000
Click back to the cat sprite, and 
we're going to enter some more code.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,720
This time the code tells the 
cat to display the results.

3
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,880
Let's see if it works.

4
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:21,080
Select the canvas sprite and go to costumes.

5
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:28,800
With a black paintbrush selected, draw a picture.

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,240
Press space to see the results.

7
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:36,040
Try a banana too!

8
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:49,480
Click back to the cat and add some code to check 
how confident the model is with its prediction.

9
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:59,240
Now draw something that is 
not an apple or a banana.

